From 9de2341e74866157b76f349f58bbc2fbd61615c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pviano-ria <pviano@riasolutionsgroup.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:28:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Fix XML doc-comment warnings in the generated library

Gtk4/refactor migrations left doc comments stranded. Clear every remaining
CS1572/CS1573/CS1587/CS1711:

- Delete the orphaned "Called when the control is drawn" blocks left when
  OnDrawn was replaced by OnSnapshot (BoxBase, LayoutBase, ScrollableBoxBase,
  TabControlBase, TabPageBase, TableLayoutPanelBase).
- Move the docs displaced onto the wrong member back to their method:
  CloseWindow (FormBase), RunDialog (Gtk4Compat), OnSelectedIndexChanged
  (ComboBox), AddMemu (ToolStripItemCollection), AddClass (ScrollableBoxBase).
- Correct PictureBoxBase.DrawingArea_DrawFunc params (o/args -> area/cr/width/height).
- Drop the stray <typeparam name="T"> on the non-generic ScrollbarBase.
---
 Gtk.Windows.Forms/GTKSystem/Gtk4Compat.cs     | 16 +++++-----
 .../Forms/GtkControls/ControlBase/BoxBase.cs  |  8 -----
 .../Forms/GtkControls/ControlBase/FormBase.cs | 32 +++++++++----------
 .../GtkControls/ControlBase/LayoutBase.cs     |  8 -----
 .../GtkControls/ControlBase/PictureBoxBase.cs | 17 +++++++---
 .../ControlBase/ScrollableBoxBase.cs          | 19 +++++------
 .../GtkControls/ControlBase/ScrollbarBase.cs  |  2 --
 .../GtkControls/ControlBase/TabControlBase.cs |  8 -----
 .../GtkControls/ControlBase/TabPageBase.cs    |  8 -----
 .../ControlBase/TableLayoutPanelBase.cs       |  8 -----
 .../System/Windows/Forms/ComboBox.cs          | 14 ++++----
 .../MenuStripBase/ToolStripItemCollection.cs  | 18 +++++------
 12 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 98 deletions(-)

